WEBVTT

00:04.604 --> 00:11.806
Kashimashi
~Girl Meets Girl~

00:12.979 --> 00:19.714
No matter where
you are, I'll find you.

00:21.121 --> 00:28.152
I can only watch you...
I can't even talk to you.

00:28.261 --> 00:32.721
Today is going to end,
and we can't see tomorrow.

00:33.299 --> 00:35.927
But they'll turn into a gentle color.

00:37.570 --> 00:44.032
It whirls down from
the sky... Love will shine.

00:44.511 --> 00:52.543
<i>When I turn around,
I always see your smile.</i>

00:53.853 --> 01:01.259
1 wish a day like that would come.

01:01.494 --> 01:09.333
I want to keep
looking at you up close.

01:10.103 --> 01:16.565
I'm sending these great
feelings that never end...

01:16.776 --> 01:21.736
...straight to you.

01:38.665 --> 01:41.065
According to the calendar,
it's already summer...

01:41.167 --> 01:43.294
...but the cold weather goes on.

01:43.369 --> 01:46.065
Mr. Yamai, how's
the weather down there?

01:46.506 --> 01:50.704
Yes, I'm in front of the studio.
The weather in Tokyo today is cloudy.

01:50.777 --> 01:54.736
Temperatures are still low, but hopefully
the rainy season will end soon...

02:10.797 --> 02:11.764
Yasuna.

02:14.167 --> 02:16.897
You turned
Hazumu down once, right?

02:18.905 --> 02:21.567
You hurt Hazumu's
feelings, didn't you?

02:26.379 --> 02:27.437
I know...

02:27.914 --> 02:29.882
.--1 did a terrible thing.

02:38.825 --> 02:44.024
The Things Reflected
in Yasuna's Eyes

02:44.664 --> 02:47.064
Pulse, blood pressure... normal...

02:47.167 --> 02:49.658
Wait, blood pressure is a bit low...

02:49.769 --> 02:50.565
Puu!

02:50.670 --> 02:53.366
That machine looks
very old-fashioned...

02:53.473 --> 02:57.500
Yes, people on our planet
have this nostalgia for old things.

02:57.610 --> 02:58.872
We're done.

02:58.978 --> 03:00.377
Good job!

03:01.814 --> 03:03.577
So what will you do?

03:04.350 --> 03:05.749
About love.

03:05.852 --> 03:08.980
Yasuna Kamiizumi
confessed to you, didn't she?

03:20.400 --> 03:21.924
I have no idea.

03:22.035 --> 03:25.027
How did you know?

03:26.239 --> 03:28.707
I said I would be observing, didn't 1?

03:29.242 --> 03:30.266
Well?

03:30.443 --> 03:32.274
Well...

03:33.279 --> 03:36.976
It's just that I became a girl, so...

03:37.150 --> 03:42.110
Is there a rule against same-sex
relationships on this planet?

03:42.222 --> 03:43.689
W-Well...

03:44.023 --> 03:44.990
Puu!

03:54.567 --> 03:55.864
Hey, Asuta.

03:58.104 --> 04:00.834
<i>Can I ask you something?</i>

04:01.007 --> 04:02.031
Thumpity-thump!

04:03.376 --> 04:07.437
Is there someone you like right now?

04:07.614 --> 04:09.844
Wait! Think calmly.

04:09.949 --> 04:13.350
If Hazumu's asking if I like someone,
that probably means what ll think.

04:13.453 --> 04:15.182
What now? No, don't waver!

04:15.288 --> 04:17.449
Cute and curvy... It's my chance.

04:17.557 --> 04:19.616
Stupid! That's my best friend!

04:19.726 --> 04:22.126
Wait. Hazumu
confessed knowing that.

04:22.228 --> 04:24.458
Asuta Soro!
As a friend... No, as a man...

04:24.564 --> 04:26.725
I should accept
those feelings. That's right!

04:26.833 --> 04:27.891
Hazumu!

04:28.001 --> 04:31.198
Sorry. You weren't
into things like love, right?

04:32.538 --> 04:34.802
Hey, we'll be late. Let's go.

04:37.710 --> 04:39.769
Okay! Last lap!

04:40.113 --> 04:41.239
Come on!

04:41.681 --> 04:42.648
Come on!

04:43.516 --> 04:45.814
You're dragging behind, Miss Kurusu!

04:59.499 --> 05:01.364
No no no!

05:03.536 --> 05:04.901
Another new record!

05:05.004 --> 05:07.598
Miss Kurusu sure has a lot of energy!

05:13.913 --> 05:15.107
Good morning!

05:17.884 --> 05:19.784
Good morning.

05:40.640 --> 05:44.633
Hazumu! It's not that
I'm not interested in love...

05:44.777 --> 05:48.440
It's okay. Sorry for
asking such a weird question.

05:48.548 --> 05:50.482
Hazumu...

05:50.850 --> 05:51.748
Good morning.

05:51.884 --> 05:52.873
Good morning.

06:05.898 --> 06:09.026
It's tough if you're on the stage...

06:09.168 --> 06:10.795
Hazumu!

06:11.938 --> 06:15.032
<i>Listen to what I have to say!</i>

06:16.042 --> 06:18.033
You can just keep doing that.

06:19.645 --> 06:21.340
Sketching contest?

06:23.349 --> 06:25.647
Yeah, you can join me if you like...

06:26.853 --> 06:27.820
Okay.

06:31.157 --> 06:35.025
Trying to walk pigeon-toed...
You're starting to walk like a girl.

06:35.461 --> 06:36.860
Really?

06:37.196 --> 06:38.163
Yeah.

06:40.299 --> 06:41.266
Hazumu!

06:41.701 --> 06:43.532
Tomari! Good morning.

06:43.970 --> 06:46.666
Let's draw in
the sketching contest together.

06:47.740 --> 06:48.934
Come on!

07:03.489 --> 07:06.049
Pu-pu-pu-pu-pu-pu-pu-pu-pu!

07:06.592 --> 07:08.958
Pu-pu-pu!

07:09.162 --> 07:10.686
Sunflower-puu!

07:10.797 --> 07:12.424
Now, let's begin.

07:12.632 --> 07:14.532
This is a toy, right?

07:14.634 --> 07:16.295
It's not a trick?

07:18.404 --> 07:19.962
It laughed!

07:20.873 --> 07:23.103
I used a sunflower this time...

07:23.209 --> 07:27.043
...but if you can control its genes,
you can create new life.

07:27.380 --> 07:29.371
Mr. Sora, that was amazing!

07:29.482 --> 07:33.043
Your lesson on the
mystery of life. Marvelous!

07:33.386 --> 07:36.184
What's Miss Namiko doing here?

07:36.389 --> 07:37.856
Sister Brother!

07:37.957 --> 07:39.083
Jun Puu!

07:39.392 --> 07:42.156
Be careful not to get
caught by that thing!

07:42.261 --> 07:43.592
Be careful?

07:43.830 --> 07:46.094
Hazumu, who are you talking to?

07:49.235 --> 07:51.601
Your lesson is very interesting.

07:51.737 --> 07:52.761
Thank you.

07:58.010 --> 07:59.875
It tried to attack us!

07:59.979 --> 08:01.708
This thing is dangerous.

08:02.615 --> 08:04.515
Excuse me. Your notebook...

08:05.885 --> 08:07.876
Oh, that's Umeda's.

08:08.187 --> 08:10.587
What? Umeda...

08:11.457 --> 08:13.482
Umeda, she has your notebook.

08:13.593 --> 08:15.322
Thank you, Kamiizumi.

08:15.828 --> 08:17.386
It was nothing...

08:21.567 --> 08:22.898
I knew it.

08:24.337 --> 08:27.397
Mr. Sora, what are
you doing about lunch?

08:27.673 --> 08:30.904
I actually made some
lunch for you today.

08:31.010 --> 08:33.035
Yasuna Kamiizumi...

08:33.145 --> 08:34.112
Huh?

08:34.280 --> 08:35.747
Hey, Hazumu!

08:35.848 --> 08:36.473
Yes?

08:36.582 --> 08:39.016
Could you go
to the art room and get...

08:39.085 --> 08:41.747
...the pictures from
last year's sketching contest?

08:41.854 --> 08:43.455
I'll give them back to everyone.

08:43.456 --> 08:44.616
I'll give them back to everyone.
All right.

08:44.724 --> 08:46.851
Can you bring this to the classroom?

08:46.926 --> 08:47.654
Okay.

08:47.760 --> 08:50.251
Now, Mr. Sora, let's go.

08:50.363 --> 08:52.923
No, I'm heading
to the art room as well.

08:53.032 --> 08:54.056
How sad...

08:55.034 --> 08:56.558
Let's go, Osaragi.

08:56.636 --> 08:57.534
Right.

08:57.770 --> 08:59.032
No...

08:59.138 --> 09:01.003
Wait for me!

09:05.545 --> 09:06.637
Let's see...

09:06.846 --> 09:10.714
Last year's work, so it
has to be the freshmen's...

09:12.685 --> 09:13.617
Got it.

09:13.719 --> 09:15.346
Give me that.

09:20.660 --> 09:22.218
<i>Just as I thought...</i>

09:24.564 --> 09:26.794
This is Yasuna's...

09:27.433 --> 09:28.627
That's me.

09:28.768 --> 09:31.669
<i>But this picture... I have no face.</i>

09:32.438 --> 09:34.906
Asuta should be next to me, but...

09:35.308 --> 09:36.536
Why...

09:36.776 --> 09:38.744
You still don't get it?

09:45.318 --> 09:50.415
Looks like you still don't know
anything about Yasuna Kamiizumi.

10:03.202 --> 10:04.965
I'll say it was an accident.

10:05.071 --> 10:07.869
I went inside without knowing
my daughter was there.

10:07.974 --> 10:10.033
Then it won't sound crazy.

10:12.979 --> 10:13.946
Oh.

10:14.113 --> 10:15.341
Sorry.

10:16.382 --> 10:17.406
Father...

10:18.951 --> 10:21.977
I'll wash your back since you're here.

10:22.455 --> 10:24.286
What the hell are you doing?

10:24.390 --> 10:26.085
It was an accident!

10:26.192 --> 10:27.819
You can't fool me!

10:39.605 --> 10:44.338
Looks like you still don't know
anything about Yasuna Kamiizumi.

10:46.312 --> 10:48.246
Don't know anything...

10:48.547 --> 10:53.610
Now, I'll give you back
the drawings from last year's contest!

11:07.733 --> 11:08.700
Okay!

11:09.101 --> 11:12.628
Now you folks can
go wherever you want!

11:12.905 --> 11:16.432
You can go anywhere
you like and have three hours...

11:18.411 --> 11:20.538
...to finish the drawing!

11:20.646 --> 11:21.704
Okay, let's go.

11:21.781 --> 11:22.748
Yeah.

11:23.315 --> 11:24.213
Hazumu.

11:24.383 --> 11:25.315
Hazumu.

11:25.851 --> 11:27.785
Let's draw together.

11:48.040 --> 11:52.067
Man, I'm just not good
at drawing things...

11:55.114 --> 11:56.877
What's Hazumu doing?

11:56.949 --> 11:58.610
Leave them alone.

11:58.718 --> 12:00.310
Ouch! Let go!

12:00.419 --> 12:01.852
Um...

12:02.988 --> 12:05.616
Aren't we supposed
to draw the scenery?

12:06.292 --> 12:09.193
I was thinking
of drawing you, Hazumu...

12:09.295 --> 12:11.593
<i>I was thinking of drawing you too.</i>

12:11.731 --> 12:13.096
Really?

12:15.234 --> 12:16.667
Is that me?

12:16.769 --> 12:20.603
<i>Yeah, I had some time the other day,
so I decided to draw you.</i>

12:20.840 --> 12:23.035
I couldn't draw it that well...

12:23.142 --> 12:24.074
Wow...

12:27.246 --> 12:29.237
Do you remember this, Hazumu?

12:29.348 --> 12:30.474
Oh, that...

12:30.583 --> 12:32.642
From elementary school...

12:32.752 --> 12:35.220
You were always
drawing that, Tomari.

12:35.621 --> 12:37.680
What do you think, Yasuna?

12:37.923 --> 12:42.690
I think it looks like you,
but you're a girl now, Hazumu.

12:42.962 --> 12:44.691
You're right.

12:45.030 --> 12:47.624
But Hazumu will always be Hazumu!

12:47.767 --> 12:49.997
You're right, but...

12:52.138 --> 12:54.299
Um, you two...

12:55.141 --> 12:57.302
What are you saying?

12:58.344 --> 13:00.244
I asked you last time, right?

13:00.346 --> 13:03.838
Whether you knew how much
you hurt Hazumu's feelings.

13:06.519 --> 13:07.508
1 know.

13:08.154 --> 13:08.882
But...

13:08.988 --> 13:10.819
You don't know anything!

13:11.991 --> 13:15.358
If you did, then you
wouldn't be able to do this!

13:15.461 --> 13:20.865
Even if Hazumu did ask to be friends
again, for you to confess like that...

13:20.966 --> 13:22.024
Tomari...

13:30.209 --> 13:31.540
Kurusu...

13:33.245 --> 13:35.440
You turned Hazumu down, right?

13:35.681 --> 13:39.549
So draw the line between friends
and lovers! What you're doing is...

13:39.652 --> 13:41.176
Stop it, Tomari!

13:57.970 --> 14:00.905
Let's not do this...

14:02.575 --> 14:04.543
I see that you're all back.

14:04.844 --> 14:07.642
Then we'll call it a day.

14:07.780 --> 14:11.375
If you couldn't finish,
I want you to by next week...

14:11.483 --> 14:15.783
So draw the line between friends
and lovers! What you're doing is...

14:15.888 --> 14:17.583
Stop it, Tomari!

14:39.612 --> 14:40.806
Yasuna.

14:46.619 --> 14:49.019
Do you want to head home together?

14:49.121 --> 14:52.579
Tomari has to take
supplementary lessons, so I'm alone.

14:53.659 --> 14:54.626
Okay.

14:56.795 --> 14:58.057
Flowers...

14:58.230 --> 15:00.198
It's almost summer, so...

15:01.066 --> 15:03.034
Kurusu was right.

15:03.602 --> 15:06.935
I shouldn't stay
by your side, Hazumu.

15:08.007 --> 15:09.304
Yasuna.

15:09.775 --> 15:10.867
I'm sorry.

15:11.010 --> 15:11.977
Wait!

15:13.212 --> 15:16.147
I want you to tell me
something about yourself...

15:16.248 --> 15:20.446
I saw your drawing from
last year's sketching contest.

15:22.121 --> 15:26.080
Then I realized that
I don't know anything...

15:26.892 --> 15:30.055
<i>That I don't know
anything about you...</i>

15:30.963 --> 15:33.193
<i>So I want you to tell me.</i>

15:36.068 --> 15:37.592
Hazumu.

15:42.341 --> 15:44.809
I don't want you to be surprised...

15:46.111 --> 15:47.043
I..

15:50.516 --> 15:52.507
...can't see men.

15:53.719 --> 15:54.981
Yasuna...

15:55.688 --> 15:57.815
First, it was my father.

16:00.492 --> 16:02.323
I'm sorry, Papa.

16:02.428 --> 16:04.828
But it wasn't me.

16:05.531 --> 16:07.499
It was Fermata.

16:10.302 --> 16:13.032
<i>Ever since I can remember...</i>

16:13.772 --> 16:16.070
...they suddenly disappeared.

16:16.241 --> 16:19.074
I can only sense their presence.

16:20.145 --> 16:24.309
<i>Then I couldn't
understand anything anymore.</i>

16:25.284 --> 16:29.277
Men completely
disappeared from my world.

16:31.323 --> 16:35.453
No matter how hard I try,
I can only see a dim shape.

16:38.330 --> 16:41.265
There were times when
people misunderstood me...

16:42.634 --> 16:45.967
<i>...because I couldn't tell
who was who among guys.</i>

16:47.139 --> 16:50.734
<i>I hurt many people's feelings
without being aware of it.</i>

16:51.210 --> 16:52.575
That's why...

16:53.579 --> 16:56.343
I decided to live on my own.

16:57.216 --> 17:00.777
If I don't get friendly
with anyone, then I can't hurt them.

17:01.420 --> 17:03.513
<i>That's what I thought.</i>

17:11.830 --> 17:14.128
But you showed up.

17:14.767 --> 17:18.168
<i>You were a boy, but I could see you.</i>

17:22.641 --> 17:24.404
Sorry I'm late.

17:24.510 --> 17:27.775
Today's hot, so you
want to drink a lot, right?

17:40.359 --> 17:41.656
A boy...

17:47.800 --> 17:49.358
I can see him.

17:49.802 --> 17:51.702
I was surprised.

17:51.804 --> 17:53.931
No, it wasn't just that.

17:54.206 --> 17:58.302
My whole world was about
to change... It was revolutionary.

18:02.414 --> 18:04.848
<i>But I was scared at the same time.</i>

18:04.950 --> 18:10.115
<i>I was afraid that you'd eventually
become invisible like my papa...</i>

18:10.622 --> 18:13.250
That you'd disappear from my life...

18:13.692 --> 18:14.954
That's why...

18:18.197 --> 18:19.425
<i>I'm sorry!</i>

18:19.798 --> 18:21.732
I regret doing that.

18:21.934 --> 18:25.836
It was painful and tough.
I thought my heart would explode.

18:25.971 --> 18:27.632
I blamed myself.

18:27.773 --> 18:29.866
For leaving you...

18:30.409 --> 18:33.173
You tried to be there by my side...

18:33.312 --> 18:35.576
<i>...but why was I scared?</i>

18:42.654 --> 18:45.054
Then you came back.

18:46.492 --> 18:50.451
As a girl who will never
disappear from my sight.

18:52.731 --> 18:53.755
Yasuna.

18:54.500 --> 18:56.365
Now you know, right?

18:56.468 --> 18:59.494
I hurt you to suit
my own convenience.

19:00.038 --> 19:03.735
And now that you're a girl,
I'm trying to go after you.

19:04.143 --> 19:06.634
I'm mean and selfish.

19:07.479 --> 19:10.141
<i>But I want you
to believe at least this.</i>

19:10.249 --> 19:12.683
Even when you were a boy...

19:12.851 --> 19:13.875
No...

19:14.653 --> 19:18.612
I've always loved you from
the very first moment I met you.

19:21.226 --> 19:24.957
You were the only one in my heart.

19:29.001 --> 19:30.093
<i>I'm sorry!</i>

19:31.603 --> 19:35.266
<i>I know I shouldn't be
by your side, but...</i>

19:36.275 --> 19:38.300
I don't know what to do.

19:38.610 --> 19:40.976
I don't know what to do anymore...

19:42.447 --> 19:43.277
Yasuna!

20:03.001 --> 20:05.595
Yasuna was always lonely.

20:06.071 --> 20:07.299
But I...

20:08.307 --> 20:12.073
I didn't even notice
her pain or her despair.

20:12.744 --> 20:15.736
Yasuna really needed me.

21:17.242 --> 21:18.641
Yasuna...

21:23.482 --> 21:25.382
You know...

21:34.860 --> 21:36.225
Yasuna...

21:38.363 --> 21:41.161
I don't want to regret anymore.

21:49.541 --> 21:52.806
I have to accept her feelings.

21:53.545 --> 21:56.673
She's been hurt too many times.

22:28.947 --> 22:35.011
1 look for the reason
behind these unstable feelings...

22:35.387 --> 22:41.792
...by standing still
and talking about it.

22:41.893 --> 22:47.889
But the truth is
I've already decided...

22:48.266 --> 22:54.865
...to keep on walking this path.

22:56.375 --> 23:02.473
Looking for the truth...
My joyful heart...

23:02.881 --> 23:09.684
...was seeking you.

23:12.691 --> 23:18.823
<i>At the end of all the confusion
is a wish that I embraced...</i>

23:19.231 --> 23:25.466
I said I'm here
right now in a hoarse voice.

23:25.670 --> 23:31.939
Maintain that peaceful smile of yours.

23:32.110 --> 23:39.482
<i>I'll try my best
so don't let go of that hand.</i>

23:41.887 --> 23:45.823
Our future is just around the corner.

23:56.067 --> 23:58.228
<i>Why do I try to remember?</i>

23:58.336 --> 24:01.169
My feelings will never reach anyway.

24:01.973 --> 24:04.942
Next time on Kashimashi
~Girl Meets Girl~.

24:05.110 --> 24:06.941
The Bride and the Groom.

24:07.045 --> 24:09.309
These feelings... in my heart.
